    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deadcam is a first-person psychological horror game where you can see a reactive live-feed facecam of the very thing you must survive.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.poster.avif?t=1755547346\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.webm?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.mp4?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sealed shut inside a rural, abandoned house for a paranormal hunting TV show.. Something becomes VERY wrong with your crew member\u00a0Margo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.poster.avif?t=1755547346\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.webm?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.mp4?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her live headcam is still rolling.. and you can see the whole thing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/78f5fdfb4b5ae39958d1cdac1d0c6982.poster.avif?t=1755547346\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/78f5fdfb4b5ae39958d1cdac1d0c6982.webm?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/78f5fdfb4b5ae39958d1cdac1d0c6982.mp4?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, hide, and escape the house in this first-person survival horror.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/2f17cc34f75ccc7e1e8de0f69b6cb607.poster.avif?t=1755547346\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/2f17cc34f75ccc7e1e8de0f69b6cb607.webm?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/2f17cc34f75ccc7e1e8de0f69b6cb607.mp4?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And remember: the raccoon knows everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DEADCAM</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Set in a rural, abandoned house in the great wilderness, three amateur ghost hunters lock themselves inside to film a new episode for their failing paranormal hunting TV show <i>'The Ghoul Hunters.'</i> Desperate for higher ratings, the shows producer Dom will do whatever it takes to raise the stakes and keep the show alive.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But things take a turn for the worst almost instantly - and it's already too late. Something is <strong>very</strong> wrong with Margo. Dom fled and sealed the exit to keep Margo contained, leaving you for dead with her. And when you see Margo, you might wish you were.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Margo's live headcam is still rolling: you can see her <strong>reactive</strong> face the whole time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for any creaky floorboards and don't make too much noise: <strong>Margo can hear your movements.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Margo's face will respond to <strong>your characters actions.</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>sneak, hide, and escape</strong> the house. And whatever you do, <strong>stay away from Margo.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the <strong>Raccoon</strong>.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you make it out alive - or will you become the final episode that never aired? If you want to survive.. The Raccoon may be your only ally.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/1c96fecf5afd7afcc13cd17f90ed35ed.avif?t=1755547346\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Alien Big Cat. Solo developer. Psychological thriller / horror games. MORE games coming soon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Deadcam is a first-person psychological horror game where you can see a reactive live-feed facecam of the very thing you must survive.\u00a0</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.poster.avif?t=1755547346\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.webm?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/395fab9e7454cf0d3a45829a31f26638.mp4?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sealed shut inside a rural, abandoned house for a paranormal hunting TV show.. Something becomes VERY wrong with your crew member\u00a0Margo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.poster.avif?t=1755547346\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.webm?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/9516916171cb8cdcd391919658f0983b.mp4?t=1755547346\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Her live headcam is still rolling.. and you can see the whole thing.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://sh