g> wrong with Margo. Dom fled and sealed the exit to keep Margo contained, leaving you for dead with her. And when you see Margo, you might wish you were.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Margo's live headcam is still rolling: you can see her <strong>reactive</strong> face the whole time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch out for any creaky floorboards and don't make too much noise: <strong>Margo can hear your movements.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Margo's face will respond to <strong>your characters actions.</strong>\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You must <strong>sneak, hide, and escape</strong> the house. And whatever you do, <strong>stay away from Margo.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trust the <strong>Raccoon</strong>.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you make it out alive - or will you become the final episode that never aired? If you want to survive.. The Raccoon may be your only ally.</strong>\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>ABOUT THE DEVELOPER</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865340/extras/1c96fecf5afd7afcc13cd17f90ed35ed.avif?t=1755547346\" width=512 height=512 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Alien Big Cat. Solo developer. Psychological thriller / horror games. MORE games coming soon.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Sealed shut inside a rural, abandoned house for a paranormal hunting TV show.. Something is VERY wrong with Margo. Her live headcam is still rolling.. and you can see the whole thing. Run, hide, and escape the house in this first-person survival horror. And remember: the raccoon knows everything.",
