    "reviews": "\u201c(Demo) It's not very often that a horror game makes me actually too scared to move, but this is legitimately freaky. This is actually freaky for real.\u201d<br>CaseOh<br><br>\u201c(Demo) That is insane. I've never seen a game do this before. I'm so freaked out.\u201d<br>KubzScouts<br><br>\u201c(Demo) That was fun, I see potential there. I like the concept.\u201d<br> MoistCr1TiKaL<br>",
